155
00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:36.280
<v Guest>The AI model needs to detect pedestrians,

156
00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:39.160
<v Guest>cars, and many other objects from the images.

157
00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:43.420
