00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:05.460
<v Guest>driving, it's just a really, really hard problem because the real world and real humans don't

341
00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:10.560
<v Guest>often behave rationally necessarily. And there's all sorts of problems that you can't think of,

342
00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:15.800
<v Guest>or that are edge cases that need to be accounted for in a model. And, you know, there's different

343
00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:21.920
<v Guest>ways to deploy a machine learning based solution to have sort of fallbacks or, you know, how do

